function filteredAccounts(){const outlet=$('accountsOutletFilter')?.value||'All outlets',supplier=$('accountsSupplierFilter')?.value||'All suppliers',status=$('accountsStatusFilter')?.value||'All statuses',dateSort=$('accountsDateSort')?.value||'invoice-desc',dateField=$('accountsDateField')?.value||'receivedDate',dateFrom=$('accountsDateFrom')?.value||'',dateTo=$('accountsDateTo')?.value||'',q=($('accountsSearch')?.value||'').trim().toLowerCase();const rows=(state.accounts||[]).filter(a=>{const d=parseDateLoose(a[dateField]||'');const dateOk=(!dateFrom&&!dateTo)|| (!!d&&(!dateFrom||d>=dateFrom)&&(!dateTo||d<=dateTo));return (outlet==='All outlets'||a.outlet===outlet)&&(supplier==='All suppliers'||a.supplier===supplier)&&(status==='All statuses'||a.paymentStatus===status)&&dateOk&&(!q||`${a.invoiceNumber} ${a.supplier} ${a.outlet}`.toLowerCase().includes(q))});const time=a=>{const d=parseDateLoose(a.receivedDate||a.createdDate||'');return d?new Date(`${d}T00:00:00`).getTime():0};const inv=(a,b)=>String(a.invoiceNumber||'').localeCompare(String(b.invoiceNumber||''),undefined,{numeric:true,sensitivity:'base'});return rows.sort((a,b)=>{if(dateSort==='invoice-asc')return inv(a,b)||time(b)-time(a);if(dateSort==='invoice-desc')return inv(b,a)||time(b)-time(a);const diff=dateSort==='oldest'?time(a)-time(b):time(b)-time(a);return diff||inv(a,b)})}
